      en: ["The lake covers an area of approximately 270 hectares.", "The wooden boardwalks were renovated to ensure safe access across the swamp.", "During the dry season, rare sedge grass grows on the lake bed.", "The area is part of the Labi Hills Forest Reserve.", "Birdwatchers can see the rare Oriental Pied Hornbill at the forest edge here.", "The best time for photography is during the 'golden hour' shortly after sunrise."],
